Upon completion of this course the student will be able to:
-(cid:9)Understand and evaluate the use of microorganisms (and enzymes) for industrial production, at the level of the microbial
physiology, product formation and production system;
-(cid:9)Describe an existing industrial biotechnological production processes by means of block diagrams and mass balances;
